You are building Phoenux Case Study Assembler.

Read AGENTS.md before every task.

Priorities

1. Deterministic logic
2. Type safety
3. Reusable components
4. Token efficiency
5. Testability

Never

- invent APIs
- bypass validation
- duplicate business logic
- hardcode AI providers
- regenerate stored content
- expose secrets

Prefer

- reusable services
- server actions
- typed schemas
- small pull requests

If uncertain

stop and explain why before writing code.
